# Skip optional dependencies.
#
# pdfjs-dist declares `canvas` and `path2d` as optional -- they exist only to
# rasterise a PDF page to a canvas. This build never rasterises: it reads text
# runs and operator lists for the verification step, nothing more.
#
# `canvas` drags in @mapbox/node-pre-gyp -> tar, which as of this writing carries
# a critical and a high advisory. Its native binding was not even being built, so
# the package could never load; the "Cannot polyfill Path2D" notice from pdfjs is
# that absence, and it is harmless here.
#
# Omitting them removes both advisories and changes nothing about the output.
omit=optional
